To provide more convenient, operative and transparent communication with the residents of the multi-apartment buildings managed by HAGBERG, full-service management company HAGBERG has developed a modern, easy and simple to use application - HAGBERG! 

Anyone living in a multi-apartment building can become an application user if the property is located in a residential house managed by HAGBERG!

myhagberg provides a modern and innovative way:
- to monitor the technical condition of the house, the schedule of the completed and planned works;
- to find out the balance of the house savings fund and its use;
- to participate in electronic surveys and to receive reports;
- to contact the house manager and to receive customer service support 24/7;
- to submit and view meter readings;
- to make payments of the bills;
- to book additional services – house cleaning, window washing, etc.

The application is available in the Latvian, Russian and English languages.

